+# ---------------------------------------------------------------- [MP8] Sampling parameters
+# [MP8] `spawn_radius` is the minimum distance between points (4.0), and a 12x12 box rarely holds more
+# than 11 such points, so vanilla's unbounded `while` can hang the server in initialize().
+const MP8_HARD_CEILING: int = 24     # replaces vanilla's hard-coded 10 in spawn_crates
+
+# [MP8] Above four players, forklift_certified's _mp8v_set_crate_region sets a world XZ rectangle, the free
+# centre cell of the eight bays; an empty region keeps the shipped 12x12 box. The cap is the shipped 10 at every count.
+var mp8_spawn_region: Rect2 = Rect2()
